---
title: Styleguide
layout: base.njk
description: Design system reference for the DLF Forum 2026 site.
permalink: /styleguide/
---

{% set colorTokens = [
    { name: 'Primary', token: '--color-primary', hex: '#4677C2', text: 'var(--color-on-primary)' },
    { name: 'Primary Container', token: '--color-primary-container', hex: '#4677C2', text: 'var(--color-on-primary-container)' },
    { name: 'Accent', token: '--color-accent', hex: '#BF5F36', text: 'var(--color-on-primary)' },
    { name: 'Secondary', token: '--color-secondary', hex: '#7C7261', text: 'var(--color-on-secondary)' },
    { name: 'Surface', token: '--color-surface', hex: '#FDFAF5', text: 'var(--color-on-surface)' },
    { name: 'Surface High', token: '--color-surface-container-high', hex: '#EBE2D0', text: 'var(--color-on-surface)' },
    { name: 'Outline', token: '--color-outline', hex: '#8B8071', text: '#FFFFFF' },
    { name: 'Info', token: '--color-info', hex: '#2F5D8A', text: '#FFFFFF' },
    { name: 'Success', token: '--color-success', hex: '#2F6A4F', text: '#FFFFFF' },
    { name: 'Error', token: '--color-error', hex: '#BA1A1A', text: '#FFFFFF' }
] %}

{% set fontTokens = [
    { label: 'Headline', family: 'Manrope', token: '--font-headline', specimen: 'Community. Preservation. Momentum.' },
    { label: 'Body', family: 'Public Sans', token: '--font-body', specimen: 'A practical sans for editorial copy, navigation, and dense interface text.' },
    { label: 'Mono', family: 'IBM Plex Mono', token: '--font-mono', specimen: 'TOKEN / STATUS / 2026-04-06 / READY' }
] %}

<div class="styleguide-shell pt-36 pb-24">
    <section class="px-6 sm:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
            <div class="surface-card overflow-hidden p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16">
                <div class="max-w-3xl">
                    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Design System</p>
                    <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-on-surface sm:text-6xl lg:text-[5rem]">
                        Styleguide for a warm editorial interface.
                    </h1>
                    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant sm:text-xl">
                        This system extends the current DLF Forum site with clearer component patterns, expanded semantic colors, and a typography stack that can support both storytelling and interface detail.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-primary px-5 py-6 text-on-primary shadow-[var(--shadow-lifted)]">
                        <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-on-primary/70">Voice</p>
                        <p class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold">Confident, accessible, modern.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-accent-soft px-5 py-6 text-[#5a2d18]">
                        <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#8a4729]">Palette</p>
                        <p class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold">Soft neutrals with deliberate signal colors.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-surface-container px-5 py-6 text-on-surface">
                        <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-on-surface-variant">System</p>
                        <p class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold">Reusable patterns for content and interface states.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-20 px-6 sm:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
            <div class="mb-8">
                <p class="eyebrow">Color</p>
                <h2 class="section-title mt-3">Core palette and semantic states</h2>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    The palette keeps the site grounded in warm paper tones while adding stronger accents for calls to action, informational messaging, and status feedback.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-5">
                {% for swatch in colorTokens %}
                    <article class="surface-card overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="h-36" style="background: var({{ swatch.token }}); color: {{ swatch.text }};">
                            <div class="flex h-full items-end p-5">
                                <span class="rounded-full bg-black/10 px-3 py-1 font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Swatch</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-5">
                            <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">{{ swatch.name }}</h3>
                            <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-on-surface-variant">{{ swatch.token }}</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-sm text-on-surface-variant">{{ swatch.hex }}</p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>

            <div class="showcase-grid mt-8">
                <div class="surface-card p-8">
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Usage notes</h3>
                    <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                        <li><strong class="text-on-surface">Primary blue</strong> is for high-priority actions, active states, and major navigation emphasis.</li>
                        <li><strong class="text-on-surface">Accent clay</strong> is reserved for highlights, badges, and editorial moments where the interface needs warmth.</li>
                        <li><strong class="text-on-surface">Soft semantic colors</strong> support alerts and status messaging without overpowering page content.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="surface-card p-8">
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Token summary</h3>
                    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                        <div class="rounded-[1.25rem] bg-surface-container-low p-4">
                            <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-on-surface-variant">Backgrounds</p>
                            <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-on-surface">surface, surface-container, surface-container-high</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-[1.25rem] bg-surface-container-low p-4">
                            <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-on-surface-variant">Action</p>
                            <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-on-surface">primary, accent, on-primary</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-[1.25rem] bg-info-soft p-4">
                            <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#244766]">Messaging</p>
                            <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-[#153958]">info, success, error</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-[1.25rem] bg-accent-soft p-4">
                            <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#8a4729]">Borders</p>
                            <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-[#5a2d18]">outline, outline-variant</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-20 px-6 sm:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
            <div class="mb-8">
                <p class="eyebrow">Typography</p>
                <h2 class="section-title mt-3">Type styles and font names</h2>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    The system uses one expressive display family, one practical UI and body family, and one mono face for metadata, labels, and implementation references.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-6">
                {% for font in fontTokens %}
                    <article class="surface-card p-8 sm:p-10">
                        <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:items-start">
                            <div>
                                <p class="eyebrow">{{ font.label }}</p>
                                <h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">{{ font.family }}</h3>
                                <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-on-surface-variant">{{ font.token }}</p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                {% if font.label == 'Headline' %}
                                    <p class="font-headline text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)] font-extrabold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.06em] text-on-surface">{{ font.specimen }}</p>
                                {% elif font.label == 'Body' %}
                                    <p class="font-body text-xl leading-9 text-on-surface-variant">{{ font.specimen }}</p>
                                {% else %}
                                    <p class="font-mono text-xl leading-8 text-on-surface">{{ font.specimen }}</p>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-20 px-6 sm:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
            <div class="mb-8">
                <p class="eyebrow">Components</p>
                <h2 class="section-title mt-3">Reusable style components</h2>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                    These examples establish a consistent visual language for actions, content blocks, forms, and status messages across future pages.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="showcase-grid">
                <article class="surface-card p-8">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Actions</p>
                    <h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Buttons and links</h3>
                    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                        <a href="#0" class="button-primary">Primary button</a>
                        <a href="#0" class="button-secondary">Secondary button</a>
                        <a href="#0" class="button-ghost">Ghost button</a>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                        Use the <a href="#0" class="text-link">text link treatment</a> for inline pathways inside editorial copy.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="surface-card p-8">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Cards</p>
                    <h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Content blocks</h3>
                    <div class="mt-6 rounded-[1.5rem] bg-surface-container-low p-6">
                        <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Featured Track</p>
                        <h4 class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Sustainable infrastructure for digital collections</h4>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">
                            Pair editorial hierarchy with a clear supporting paragraph and one deliberate action.
                        </p>
                        <a href="#0" class="button-secondary mt-6">Read more</a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="surface-card p-8">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Forms</p>
                    <h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Inputs and labels</h3>
                    <div class="mt-6 space-y-5">
                        <div>
                            <label class="form-label" for="sg-name">Full name</label>
                            <input id="sg-name" class="form-field" type="text" placeholder="Jordan Lee">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="form-label" for="sg-topic">Session topic</label>
                            <select id="sg-topic" class="form-field">
                                <option>Choose a track</option>
                                <option>Metadata</option>
                                <option>Preservation</option>
                                <option>Community Practice</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="surface-card p-8">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Alerts</p>
                    <h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Callouts and status</h3>
                    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
                        <div class="callout callout-info">
                            <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em]">Informational</p>
                            <p class="mt-2 text-lg leading-8">Use this for registration updates, deadline notices, or guidance that should be visible but calm.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="callout callout-success">
                            <p class="font-label text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em]">Success</p>
                            <p class="mt-2 text-lg leading-8">Reserve this for confirmed submissions, successful form states, or completed workflows.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="surface-card p-8 md:col-span-2">
                    <p class="eyebrow">Navigation</p>
                    <h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-on-surface">Primary navigation pattern</h3>
                    <div class="mt-6 rounded-[1.75rem] border border-outline-variant/40 bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]">
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
                            <div class="font-headline text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-on-primary-fixed-variant">DLF Forum 2026</div>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                                <span class="rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2 font-label text-sm font-bold text-on-primary">Home</span>
                                <span class="rounded-full px-4 py-2 font-label text-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">Program</span>
                                <span class="rounded-full px-4 py-2 font-label text-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">About</span>
                                <span class="rounded-full border border-outline-variant/50 px-4 py-2 font-label text-sm font-bold text-on-primary-fixed-variant">Submit a Proposal</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
